                <mxCell id="16" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Usa ObjectOutputStream para enviar objetos&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A classe nodeServer tem uma thread sempre ativa para cada conexão à espera de receber mensagens, ao receber alguma coisa ativa o handleMessage ( )&amp;nbsp; do node&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;width: 18px; height: 28px; padding: 0px; position: absolute; cursor: copy; left: 1404px; top: 831px; opacity: 0.15; visibility: visible;&quot; title=&quot;Click to connect and clone (ctrl+click to clone, shift+click to connect). Drag to connect (ctrl+drag to clone).&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; src=&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;width: 18px; height: 26px; padding: 0px; position: absolute; cursor: copy; left: 1404px; top: 962px; opacity: 0.15; visibility: visible;&quot; title=&quot;Click to connect and clone (ctrl+click to clone, shift+click to connect). Drag to connect (ctrl+drag to clone).&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; src=&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;width: 26px; height: 18px; padding: 0px; position: absolute; cursor: copy; left: 1464px; top: 902px; opacity: 0.15; visibility: visible;&quot; title=&quot;Click to connect and clone (ctrl+click to clone, shift+click to connect). Drag to connect (ctrl+drag to clone).&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; src=&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;width: 28px; height: 18px; padding: 0px; position: absolute; cursor: copy; left: 1334px; top: 902px; opacity: 0.15; visibility: visible;&quot; title=&quot;Click to connect and clone (ctrl+click to clone, shift+click to connect). Drag to connect (ctrl+drag to clone).&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; src=&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,&quot;&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;left: 212px; bottom: 0px; right: 240px; height: 36px;&quot; class=&quot;geTabContainer geTabItem&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;width: 30px;&quot; title=&quot;Pages&quot; class=&quot;geTab geControlTab&quot;&gt;&lt;div style